---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Ahpra-safe implant marketing"
  description="How Hero Digital reviews implant and full-arch content against Ahpra advertising rules before anything is published. Operational practice, not legal advice."
  path="/dental-implants/ahpra-compliance/"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Compliance"
    title="Ahpra advertising rules sit in the workflow, not in a footnote."
    lead="This page describes how we work. It is not legal advice, and it is not an Ahpra, ADA or government endorsement."
    crumbs={[
      { href: '/', label: 'Home' },
      { href: '/dental-implants/', label: 'Dental implants' },
      { href: '/dental-implants/ahpra-compliance/', label: 'Ahpra compliance' },
    ]}
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <h2>What never goes out</h2>
      <p>We do not publish patient testimonials, clinical before-and-afters, or wording that guarantees a clinical or marketing result. We do not use “#1”, “best” or “guaranteed patients” as claims about your clinic.</p>
      <h2>The gates</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>An AI pre-screen against a written checklist</li>
        <li>A human Ahpra reviewer</li>
        <li>Your written approval before the asset goes live</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Targets on retainers are aims set from your baseline. They are reported, including when we are behind, and they are not guarantees. For questions about your own advertising obligations, speak to your professional adviser.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/free-audit/">Request a free audit</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
